      "title": "Partner program",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.ongage.com/partner-program/",
      "description": "Become an Ongage Champion Skip to content Product Our platform AI Analytics Email integrations Services Pricing Company About us Why Ongage Resources Email deliverability handbook Email marketing activity book Video tutorials Case studies Comparisons Glossary Press FAQ API FAQ Manuals Blog All blogs Newsletter examples Email subject lines Re-engagement emails Academy Product Our platform AI Analytics Email integrations Services Pricing Company About us Why Ongage Resources Email deliverability handbook Email marketing activity book Video tutorials Case studies Comparisons Glossary Press FAQ API FAQ Manuals Blog All blogs Newsletter examples Email subject lines Re-engagement emails Academy Contact | Login Start today Start today Start today Become an Ongage Champion We’re always on the lookout for more friends, and you’re the best person to get the word out. For every new Ongage client you bring, You’ll enjoy 15% of the revenue. That’s on top of that warm and fuzzy feeling of helping your friends send campaigns that land in more inboxes! That’s what turns people into champions. Share and recommend Ongage to your friends! It’s easy as 1-2-3 Our champion program is as straightforward as it gets. Just follow these three simple steps to become an Ongage champion. Step 1 Make an intro to our Sales team . Step 2 Get 15% of all revenues collected in the first year of business. Step 3 Refer more friends and grow your piggy bank further. Why should you become an Ongage champion? Our product rocks – The Ongage email marketing platform simplifies and enhances email operations with a wealth of well-rounded capabilities like personalization, automation, and in-depth reporting. We’ll help you get started – Once you join our champion program, we’ll provide you with various marketing materials that make it clear Ongage is the right fit for your friends. Additional revenue stream – You get 15% of every client you refer to us. What’s not to like? Who do we partner with? Email delivery vendors that manage and send emails. Email technology and service providers that provide a complementary email service. Consultants who want to recommend Ongage as part of their services. People who are passionate about Ongage and want to spread the word. Ready, set, go! Ready to bring your friends to the remarkable Ongage family? Thank you for reaching out! You’ll be hearing from us soon. Close Looking for other ways to collaborate? We include our partners in content, social, and community operations. With Ongage, you’ll be able to show what you have and shine in front of an engaged audience. Check out the possibilities below, or head on to our partners page . Shared events Co-hosting, collaborating, and co-promoting events and conferences. Cross promotions Sharing together exclusive promotional offers via email, social, paid and more. Referrals Join our Champion program , refer potential clients to Ongage, and enjoy 15% of the revenue Case studies Find an interesting story about a shared client. Create the content and both sides will distribute across all channels. Webinars Educational content hosted by both Ongage and the partner. PR Collaborations Create and join relevant PR campaigns that celebrate Ongage partnership announcements. Thought leadership Talk about what you do best, and get recognized for platform capabilities and your expertise. Guest posts Each party writes a comprehensive, educational blog published and promoted by the other side. Visit our guidelines page for more info. Social sharing Reposting each other’s content on social channels. A monthly email will be sent from Ongage summarizing the activity. Shared blog posts Writing content together and appearing in each other’s blogs as experts about the subject. Logos exchange Each party will feature the other’s logo on their website/ partners page. Videos & panels Experts from both companies are replying to guests’ questions, live. FAQs! What’s in it for me? You’ll get 15% of all revenues collected in the first year of business. Plus, your friends will love you for introducing Ongage to them. When are payments made? Payments will be made quarterly. A detailed report will be sent with each payment. Any caveats I should know about? Just a couple. To receive the payment, a lead must convert to a client within 3 months of the intro. Also, the lead must not already be in touch with Ongage. What if I made a successful intro in the past? Payments apply only on future introductions and not retroactively. I want to create other partnership opportunities with Ongage. Who do I talk to? We’d love to chat with you. Contact us and let us know what you have in mind. Our platform Pricing Email integrations Services Request a demo Login Our platform Pricing Email integrations Services Request a demo Login About us Why Ongage Partner program Partners Careers Legal About us Why Ongage Partner program Partners Careers Legal Email deliverability handbook Email marketing activity book Case studies Glossary Press FAQ API FAQ Manuals Email deliverability handbook Email marketing activity book Case studies Glossary Press FAQ API FAQ Manuals All blogs Newsletter examples Email subject lines Re-engagement emails All blogs Newsletter examples Email subject lines Re-engagement emails Stay in touch info@ongage.com Facebook-f Twitter Linkedin-in Signup for our newsletter for news, product releases and best practice. By signing up you are agreeing to our Terms of Service Your data will be handled in accordance with our Privacy Policy. This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. Thanks for signing up! You’ll be hearing from us soon. Close Our platform Pricing Email integrations Services Request a demo Login Our platform Pricing Email integrations Services Request a demo Login About us Why Ongage Partner program Partners Careers Legal About us Why Ongage Partner program Partners Careers Legal Email deliverability handboo